  {
   "text": "Being left out can look, in the brain, a lot like physical pain.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.74
  },
  {
   "text": "In one study, people played a virtual ball game and were left out.",
   "start": 5.38,
   "end": 9.34
  },
  {
   "text": "The more distress they reported, the more active the anterior cingulate was.",
   "start": 9.86,
   "end": 14.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Another region was active, and linked to less distress.",
   "start": 15.36,
   "end": 18.26
  },
  {
   "text": "That sting comes with measurable brain activity.",
   "start": 19.12,
   "end": 21.9
  }
